{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17289","headline":"送张曹长工部大夫奉使西番 · 权德舆","name":"送张曹长工部大夫奉使西番","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"殊邻覆露同，奉使小司空。\n西候车徒出，南台节印雄。\n吊祠将渥命，导驿畅皇风。\n故地山河在，新恩玉帛通。\n塞云凝废垒，关月照惊蓬。\n青史书归日，翻轻五利功。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17289.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17289","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}